#, fuzzy
msgid "**Core component upgrades:** Quarkus 4 brings major upgrades across fundamental dependencies, including https://netty.io/[Netty], https://vertx.io/[Eclipse Vert.x] 5, https://hibernate.org/[Hibernate] 8, and https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson[Jackson] 3."
